# clang-tidy for the filter (make lint). Switched off:
#   signed-bitwise, narrowing, widening   bytes promote to int in every bit operation here
#   easily-swappable-parameters           (dir, name) and (width, height) are what they are
#   branch-clone, no-recursion            the encoders mirror Brother's rules one by one
#   insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling   wants C11 Annex K (fprintf_s), which macOS lacks
#   err33-c, err34-c                      unchecked fprintf to stderr; atoi in a test helper
#   signal-handler, sig30-c               the handler only sets a sig_atomic_t flag
#   include-cleaner, padding              no gain in six small files
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  cert-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  misc-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  readability-misleading-indentation,
  readability-non-const-parameter,
  readability-redundant-*,
  -bugprone-signed-bitwise,
  -hicpp-signed-bitwise,
  -bugprone-narrowing-conversions,
  -bugprone-implicit-widening-of-multiplication-result,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-branch-clone,
  -bugprone-multi-level-implicit-pointer-conversion,
  -bugprone-assignment-in-if-condition,
  -bugprone-signal-handler,
  -cert-sig30-c,
  -cert-err33-c,
  -cert-err34-c,
  -misc-no-recursion,
  -misc-include-cleaner,
  -clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.performance.Padding
